    "text": "Thermodynamics of adsorption:<br /><img src=\"assets\\st0019_307f63a40b50.jpeg\" /><br />i. <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> because gaseous phase decrease<br />ii. <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> because process is spontaneous<br />so <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math><br /><math><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></math><br />iii. <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> so adsorption is an exothermic process."
